flowchart TD
    A([Teacher opens Grading queue]) --> B[Filter status=pending_review]
    B --> C{Any items?}
    C -->|no| D([end])
    C -->|yes| E[Open submission]
    E --> F[Read student answer + rubric]
    F --> G[Set score, feedback, status]
    G --> H[PUT /submissions/:id/grade]
    H --> I{Owner of exam?}
    I -->|no| J[403]
    I -->|yes| K[Update submission]
    K --> L[FinalizeAttempt re-aggregates]
    L --> M{All graded for attempt?}
    M -->|yes| N[Send Exam Graded notification]
    M -->|no| C
    N --> C
    J --> C
